  "This dashboard is meant to analyze a drive based on a date you select, then you can pass the pointer over the lines in graph to see data details and a blue point in the map tracking the route. With this option you can analyzed a specific point location in the map, to see the speed, power, SOC, elevation and if battery heater was on.\n\nBe aware that the drive you select in the dropdown list from the top could be outside the time range of the Timeline graph, if its the case you have to click on the \"Zoom to data\" button on the graph in order to update it.\n\nTip: On Grafana you can press \"h\" to get a keyboard shortcuts if you want to change the current Zoom out time range or use the mouse to select/change the time range.": "这个仪表板用于分析所选日期的某次行程。把鼠标指针移到图表的曲线上可以查看数据详情，地图上会有一个蓝点同步显示对应的位置。这样就能查看地图上某个具体位置的车速、功率、电量、海拔以及电池加热是否开启。\n\n请注意，从顶部下拉列表选择的行程可能不在时间线图表的时间范围内，这时需要点击图表上的\"Zoom to data\"（缩放到数据）按钮来更新图表。\n\n提示：在 Grafana 中按\"h\"可以查看键盘快捷键，用于调整当前的缩放时间范围；也可以用鼠标框选来选择或修改时间范围。",
